{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28439","headline":"怀锺陵旧游四首 四 · 杜牧","name":"怀锺陵旧游四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"控压平江十万家，秋来江静镜新磨。\n城头晚鼓雷霆後，桥上游人笑语多。\n日落汀痕千里色，月当楼午一声歌。\n昔年行乐穠桃畔，醉与龙沙拣蜀罗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}